#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "Flag it with %(keyword)s"
msgstr "Al marcar cun %(keyword)s"

#: src/postulo_imap/sync.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flagging is invisible in most clients and keeps each pass short. Leaving the mailbox untouched means every recent message is read again; nothing is suggested twice either way."
msgstr "La marcaziun è invisibla en la gronda part dals clients e tegna curta mintga passada. Laschar intacta la chascha da posta munta che mintga messadi recent vegn legì danovamain; en omaduas cas na vegn nagut proponì duas giadas."

