#, fuzzy
msgid "One folder, never the inbox. Make a rule on your mail server that files recruiter mail here; Postulo reads nothing else. Every message it reads is flagged or moved afterwards, whether or not it was recognised."
msgstr "In ordinatur, mai la chascha d'entrada. Creai ina regla sin Voss server dad e-mail che deponia qua l'e-mail da recrutaders; Postulo na legia nagut auter. Mintga messadi ch'el legia vegn suenter marcà u spustà, che quel saja vegnì renconuschì u betg."

